From 593482ebc75476bcdf0ae755946b3048299d7eab Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matt C <latentcollapse@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 16:06:40 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 31/42] np2: give each NeuraJL session a state directory, and
 describe revival truthfully

A replacement kernel revives the state at the end of the last completed
call; the restart notice now says so instead of claiming every binding
is gone, and defers to the kernel's own report. NEURAJL_COMPACTION_NOTE=0
suppresses the post-compaction note for A/B trials.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
